('Golden Triangle Tour: Complete Guide for First-Time Visitors','golden-triangle-guide-first-time','Destination Guides','Planning your first Golden Triangle journey? This guide covers ideal route order, practical timings, and local etiquette for Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599661046289-e31897846e41?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80','2026-01-10 09:00:00'),
