('Rajasthan Travel Guide: Palaces, Forts & Culture','rajasthan-palaces-forts-culture','Destination Guides','From Jaipur palaces to Jaisalmer dunes, this guide helps you design a balanced Rajasthan itinerary.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1477587458883-47145ed94245?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80','2026-01-20 09:00:00'),
('Top 10 Things to Do in Delhi You Can\'t Miss','top-10-things-to-do-delhi','City Guides','Explore old Delhi food lanes, imperial avenues, and spiritual spaces in one practical checklist.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524492412937-b28074a5d7da?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80','2026-01-24 09:00:00'),
('Jaipur City: Pink City\'s Hidden Gems','jaipur-pink-city-hidden-gems','City Guides','Beyond major landmarks, discover artisan neighborhoods and lesser-known heritage corners.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599661046827-dacde6976549?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80','2026-01-29 09:00:00'),
