('Desert Safari in Jaisalmer: Adventure Awaits','jaisalmer-desert-safari-adventure','Adventure','Everything you need for camel rides, camp etiquette, and desert weather preparation.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518509562904-e7ef99cdcc86?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80','2026-02-08 09:00:00'),
